Edit the existing Echoes meditation session screen. Do not redesign the Echoes flow or change any existing text. Only add the missing controls and visual elements.

---

ADD SOUND TOGGLE ICON

Place a small control icon in the **top right corner** of the Echoes meditation screen.

Icon: Speaker

Default state: speaker icon (sound ON)

Interaction behavior:
• When tapped, the icon changes to a **speaker with a slash through it** to indicate sound OFF.
• Tapping again returns it to the normal speaker icon (sound ON).

The icon should be subtle and minimal.

---

ADD FLASHLIGHT TOGGLE ICON

Place a small control icon in the **top left corner** of the Echoes meditation screen.

Icon: Flashlight

Default state: flashlight icon (ON)

Interaction behavior:
• When tapped, the flashlight icon becomes a **flashlight with a slash through it** to indicate flashing lights OFF.
• Tapping again returns it to the normal flashlight icon (ON).

---

ICON VISUAL STYLE

Both toggle icons should have a **similar design language to the Stop Echoes Transmission button**.

• simple outline style
• subtle rounded background or outline container
• minimal visual weight

They should feel like small control buttons.

---

STOP BUTTON IMPROVEMENT

The **Stop Echoes Transmission** button should appear **more clickable** than the toggle icons.

Update it so it looks more like a primary button rather than a thin outline.

Examples:

• slightly thicker outline
• faint fill or glow
• clearer button shape

Do not change the button text.

---

TIMER POSITION

Move the **countdown timer** slightly lower on the screen so it sits closer to the Stop Echoes Transmission button.

The timer and the button should visually feel like part of the same control area.

---

BACKGROUND ANIMATION

Add a **slow, illustrated ambient animation** behind the timer.

The animation should be very subtle and calming.

Possible visual ideas:

• soft flowing shapes
• gentle moving gradient waves
• slowly expanding light pulses
• abstract organic motion

The animation should move slowly in a **breathing-like rhythm**.

Do not add bright or distracting motion.

